51
00:04:29,984 --> 00:04:32,384
But the basic idea that predicts the next word.

52
00:04:32,558 --> 00:04:42,064
Now, your first thought might be really, that is what the whole changing of the world is going to be based on, something that predicts the next word.

53
00:04:42,784 --> 00:04:44,224
Two things you have to bear in mind.

54
00:04:44,384 --> 00:05:01,744
The one is that if you feed enough data into a system like this, which is what these frontier models are trying to do, basically suck in every piece of information in the world, then you do actually get something that knows a lot of different possibilities for predicting the next word in very many domains.

55
00:05:01,824 --> 00:05:03,524
So it's actually quite powerful.

56
00:05:03,904 --> 00:05:09,904
The second thing to bear in mind is if you think this is not how we operate, think again.

57
00:05:10,158 --> 00:05:11,556
