00:20:47,536 --> 00:20:51,856
But now the question would be why would you want to review 30,000 changes a day anyway?

205
00:20:52,176 --> 00:20:56,576
Because if it's just for looking for bugs, I've got news for you.

206
00:20:56,750 --> 00:20:59,536
These agents can find these bugs better than you can anyway.

