00:21:04,176 --> 00:21:06,276
Problem is that's actually not what you wanted to do.

209
00:21:06,496 --> 00:21:19,492
The reason why you have code reviews is not so that you can find the bugs, it is so that everybody can understand this joint product that they're working on and how your changes affects this product, That's what you're really trying to do with a code review.

