212
00:21:35,296 --> 00:21:40,036
You want to know why essentially you made this code change.

213
00:21:41,486 --> 00:21:48,356
The snag, however, is that there is quite some evidence that the quality of the code is in fact slipping.

214
00:21:48,846 --> 00:21:59,216
So we are producing more code, so 20% more pull because this is from uh Cortex Engineering in the age of AI 2026 report, so it's relatively new.

